# Laravel Boost (dev only) bakes these fresh on every boost:install and
# boost:update, so committing them would only ship yesterday's bread.
# boost.json holds each developer's own agent picks. Team guidance and
# project rules live in .ai/, which is committed. .agents/ stays tracked:
# Booster keeps its playbooks there.
